        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "task-4:14sm35w",
          "html": "Teleport to Anachronia and navigate to an area south of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Liverworts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">liverworts</a> and north of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lampenfloras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lampenfloras</a>.",
          "text": "Teleport to Anachronia and navigate to an area south of the liverworts and north of the lampenfloras.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "task-4:14sm35w:nx8d3e",
              "html": "The fastest way to get there is by teleporting to Anachronia and running slightly east to use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Orthen_teleportation_device\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Orthen teleportation device</a>. Then teleporting to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Moksha_ritual_site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Moksha ritual site</a> M and then exiting and running north-east.",
              "text": "The fastest way to get there is by teleporting to Anachronia and running slightly east to use the Orthen teleportation device. Then teleporting to the Moksha ritual site M and then exiting and running north-east.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "task-4:14sm35w:6xr1ov",
              "html": "Alternatively, leave Anachronia base camp to the north down the stairs, not via the Agility shortcut. Run east to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Liverworts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">liverworts</a>. Run south towards the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lampenfloras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lampenfloras</a>.",
              "text": "Alternatively, leave Anachronia base camp to the north down the stairs, not via the Agility shortcut. Run east to the liverworts. Run south towards the lampenfloras.",
              "dialogue": [],
